   "system": {
    "description": {
     "value": "<p>The acolyte is a 1st-level spellcaster. Its spellcasting ability is Wisdom (spell save DC 12, +4 to hit with spell attacks). The acolyte has following cleric spells prepared:• Cantrips (at will): [[/item .Bnn9Nzajixvow9xi]]{light}, [[/item .n9pJzTDsAwQxJVRl]]{sacred flame}, [[/item .MUO1uYN7JR1hm4dR]]{thaumaturgy}• 1st level (3 slots): [[/item .8dzaICjGy6mTUaUr]]{bless}, [[/item .uUWb1wZgtMou0TVP]]{cure wounds}, [[/item .gvdA9nPuWLck4tBl]]{sanctuary}</p>",
     "chat": "<p>The acolyte is a spellcaster. Its spellcasting ability is Wisdom.</p>"
